            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Update metadata fix</h2>
                <p>Quick fix release. v1.1.0's auto-updater metadata didn't match the appcast feed, which made some users see "update available" prompts even after installing v1.1.0. v1.1.1 corrects this — once you're on v1.1.1, the prompt stops.</p>
                <p>No feature changes from v1.1.0. Pure metadata cleanup.</p>
            ]]></description>
